UPDATE agent_issues SET description = description || char(10) || char(10) || 'FIRST STEP (ROADMAP-DOERS-EB-1, 2026-10-28): in qnfo-memory-mcp tool_remember_fact, write a tier (default episodic) and a role (args.role, default agent) next to source into metadata_json, and return the tier in the success reply, so every memory row carries provenance and the later consolidation step has a field to select on. Offline test in qnfo-memory-mcp with a stub GRAPH_DB and PAPER_VZ (existing exuvia.test.mjs shows the harness). Mark the change with a comment containing MEMORY-TIERING-1. Later tasks, not this one: hourly consolidation of episodic rows into semantic rows, a decay policy, and a view of consolidation counts plus retrieval hit-rate before and after. This issue closes on the measured hit-rate, not on this step.' || char(10) || 'code-task: repo=qnfo-workers path=qnfo-memory-mcp/worker.js' || char(10) || 'code-anchor: const metadata_json = JSON.stringify({ source: "qnfo-memory-mcp", timestamp: created_at });' WHERE id = 1000637 AND status = 'open' AND description NOT LIKE '%code-task:%';

-- 1000639 RM-CODEMODE-MCP-SURFACE-1
